#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:1
msgctxt "gText_Birch_Welcome"
msgid ""
"Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
"Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\p"
"My name is BIRCH.\p"
"But everyone calls me the POKéMON\n"
"PROFESSOR.\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！让你久等了！\p"
"欢迎来到宝可梦的世界！\p"
"我的名字叫小田卷。\p"
"不过大家都叫我\n"
"宝可梦博士。\p"
"$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:9
msgctxt "gText_Birch_Pokemon"
msgid ""
"This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
"\n"
"$"
msgstr ""
"这就是被称为“宝可梦”的生物。\p"
"\n"
"$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:14
msgctxt "gText_Birch_MainSpeech"
msgid ""
"This world is widely inhabited by\n"
"creatures known as POKéMON.\p"
"We humans live alongside POKéMON,\n"
"at times as friendly playmates, and\l"
"at times as cooperative workmates.\p"
"And sometimes, we band together\n"
"and battle others like us.\p"
"But despite our closeness, we don't\n"
"know everything about POKéMON.\p"
"In fact, there are many, many\n"
"secrets surrounding POKéMON.\p"
"To unravel POKéMON mysteries,\n"
"I've been undertaking research.\l"
"That's what I do.\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"这个世界上，到处都栖息着\n"
"名为宝可梦的生物。\p"
"我们人类与宝可梦一起生活，\n"
"有时是一起玩耍的好朋友，\l"
"有时是互相协助的好伙伴。\p"
"有时我们也会和宝可梦齐心协力，\n"
"与其他人进行对战。\p"
"不过，尽管我们和宝可梦如此亲近，\n"
"对它们却还不是完全了解。\p"
"事实上，关于宝可梦，\n"
"还有许许多多的未解之谜。\p"
"为了解开宝可梦的奥秘，\n"
"我一直在进行研究。\l"
"这就是我的工作。\p"
"$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:31
msgctxt "gText_Birch_AndYouAre"
msgid "And you are?$"
msgstr "那么，你是？$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:34
msgctxt "gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl"
msgid ""
"Are you a boy?\n"
"Or are you a girl?$"
msgstr ""
"你是男孩子？\n"
"还是女孩子？$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:38
msgctxt "gText_Birch_WhatsYourName"
msgid ""
"All right.\n"
"What's your name?$"
msgstr ""
"好的。\n"
"你叫什么名字？$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:42
msgctxt "gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer"
msgid "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"
msgstr "你叫{PLAYER}{KUN}，对吗？$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:45
msgctxt "gText_Birch_YourePlayer"
msgid ""
"Ah, okay!\p"
"You're {PLAYER}{KUN} who's moving to my\n"
"hometown of LITTLEROOT.\l"
"I get it now!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"啊，原来如此！\p"
"你就是要搬到我的家乡未白镇的\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}啊。\l"
"我明白了！\p"
"$"

#: data/text/birch_speech.inc:52
msgctxt "gText_Birch_AreYouReady"
msgid ""
"All right, are you ready?\p"
"Your very own adventure is about\n"
"to unfold.\p"
"Take courage, and leap into the\n"
"world of POKéMON where dreams,\l"
"adventure, and friendships await!\p"
"Well, I'll be expecting you later.\n"
"Come see me in my POKéMON LAB.\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"好了，准备好了吗？\p"
"属于你自己的冒险\n"
"即将拉开序幕。\p"
"鼓起勇气，跃入充满梦想、\n"
"冒险与友情的宝可梦世界吧！\p"
"那么，我等着你。\n"
"之后来我的宝可梦研究所找我吧。\p"
"$"
